GALLUP DAILY EMOTIONS INDEX (circa 2009-2011)
Metric: average % of adults who said YES to 10 items about yesterday
Positive items: well-rested, treated with respect, enjoyment, smile/laugh a lot, learned or did something interesting
Negative items: anger, stress, physical pain, worry, sadness
Score = mean of those 10 yes-rates. Higher = more emotional (pos + neg mixed)

